-- The lair of the gorgon (the book's Area 3 map, 10A), redrawn in our pieces. Turned half round from
-- the book's page so the stairs from the offices come up on the west, and condensed from the
-- book's 13 x 14 octagon to the mat the way the Hunting Grounds are: wider, flatter, the octagon
-- and its cut corners kept. The stairs arrive in a little landing with a door on either side
-- into the hall (the book draws its walls slanting; here they run straight, so the doors work).
-- Six petrified visitors stand where the book puts them, the two pedestals north and south, and
-- Euryale's couch at the far end with the last pedestal behind it. The south wall is left off.

